==={{LA|-}}===
[[File:Z4 Inventory.png|thumb|right|300px|The Subscreen from {{LADX|-}}]]
In {{LA}}, the Subscreen is accessed by pressing the [[Controller Buttons|START]] button. It allows Link to browse his possessions. As such, he can see his collection of items, his current item in the [[Trading Quest]], the number of [[Rupee]]s, [[Life Gauge|Heart Container]]s, and [[Secret Seashell]]s he possesses, the [[Instrument of the Sirens|Instruments of the Sirens]] he has so far, which of the Dungeon [[Small Key|Keys]] he is holding onto and whether or not he has obtained the [[Flippers]] and [[Secret Medicine]]. Link can also re-organize the location of his items in the Subscreen. Having a maximum capacity of two items equipped at once, he can decide which items he wants to equip on this screen.<ref>{{Cite|'You can select your favorite item for the A and B Buttons on the Sub-Screen. Using different items, you can fight without a sword! Try many different things to find what's right for you!'|Selecting The Item That's Right For You|LADX}}</ref> Upon holding the [[Controller Buttons|SELECT]] button on the Subscreen, Link can see how many [[Piece of Heart|Pieces of Heart]] he is missing until he fills another Heart Container.<ref>{{Cite|You've got a Piece of Heart! Press SELECT on the Subscreen to see.|N/A|LADX}}</ref> In {{LADX}}, holding the Select button also lets him know which [[Clothes]] he is wearing and the number of [[Photograph]]s that have been taken so far.

